From: 77450danik <dnsystems@email.ua>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] explorer: programs pinned to the taskbar, and shortcuts dropped on it and on Start.

The taskbar has the programs pinned to it, as Windows 7 and later: a button
for each, in the order startui.dll keeps them (User Pinned\TaskBar). The
first window of a pinned program takes its button where it stands, the last
one closed leaves it to the pin, which a click starts; its menu unpins it.
A shortcut or a program dragged onto the taskbar is pinned there; a button
held under something dragged brings up its window. Dropped on Start, it is
pinned to the Start menu, which opens when it is held over Start.
---
